Z||000000||2birds||08-26-2001||11:53 PM||||I finally found a steering wheel cover for my rotting 86 GT wheel.  It's made by Superior, called the Extra Wide Superskin.  Real leather, too.  Comes in black or grey, maybe others.  VERY good fit, comfortable.  Lacing it on was a real PITA, since I used the crossover stitch like the original.  I can see why Mr Mike gets close to $200 for his work.  Put it on over the original cover, and it really looks good.  The best part was it was opnly $16 at Discount Auto.  Pep Boys carries them too, for about the same cost.||||reg||10
